{
    "title": "Staffmark Group WorkNOW",
    "description": "Finding your next job just got easier! Staffmark Group WorkNOW is a job search app that allows you to search and apply for jobs across all Staffmark Group companies, including: Advantage Resourcing, Advantage xPO, Digital People, Hunter Hamilton, Pro Staff, and Staffmark.\r\n\r\nStaffmark Group WorkNOW allows you to:\r\n\u2022 Instantly search full-time, part-time, temporary, and temp-to-hire job opportunities\r\n\u2022 Filter your job search by location and keyword\r\n\u2022 Apply for jobs with a single tap\r\n\u2022 Track the status of your application\r\n\u2022 Accept job offers with just one tap\r\n\u2022 Get notifications of new opportunities that align with your skills and interests\r\n\u2022 View and edit your work schedule and availability\r\n\r\nDownload the Staffmark Group WorkNOW app today to easily search for jobs in light industrial, warehouse, administrative/office, customer service, marketing, accounting, finance, and more!\r\n\r\nQuestions, comments, or feedback? Please contact the Employee Support Line at 855-801-8451.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Finding your next job just got easier! Staffmark Group WorkNOW is a job search app that allows you to search and apply for jobs across all Staffmark Group companies, including: Advantage Resourcing, Advantage xPO, Digital People, Hunter Hamilton, Pro Staff, and Staffmark.<br><br>Staffmark Group WorkNOW allows you to:<br>\u2022 Instantly search full-time, part-time, temporary, and temp-to-hire job opportunities<br>\u2022 Filter your job search by location and keyword<br>\u2022 Apply for jobs with a single tap<br>\u2022 Track the status of your application<br>\u2022 Accept job offers with just one tap<br>\u2022 Get notifications of new opportunities that align with your skills and interests<br>\u2022 View and edit your work schedule and availability<br><br>Download the Staffmark Group WorkNOW app today to easily search for jobs in light industrial, warehouse, administrative/office, customer service, marketing, accounting, finance, and more!<br><br>Questions, comments, or feedback? Please contact the Employee Support Line at 855-801-8451.",
